Subject: [PATCH 27/27] test-posix: Check raise in threads and its errors

---
 test/test-posix/test-signal/CMakeLists.txt    |   1 +
 test/test-posix/test-signal/meson.build       |   5 +
 .../test-signal/test-raise-thread.c           | 152 ++++++++++++++++++
